              "title": "FRED:B069RC1/FRED:DSPI",
              "description": "B069RC1: Personal interest payments — interest paid by individuals, including interest on household debt.\nDSPI: Disposable personal income — income remaining after personal current taxes.\nRatio rising - \tMore income is being absorbed by interest payments; consumer spending may come under pressure\nRatio falling - Interest costs are taking a smaller share of disposable income",
